{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"一、八年。春王正月，公如晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"二、夏，葬鄭僖公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"賊未討，何以書葬？為中國諱也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"三、鄭人侵蔡，獲蔡公子爕。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"此侵也，其言獲何？侵而言獲者，適得之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"四、季孫宿會晉侯、鄭伯、齊人、宋人、衞人、邾婁人于刑丘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"五、公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"六、莒人伐我東鄙。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"七、秋九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"八、冬，楚公子貞帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_158_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_158","textTraditional":"九、晉侯使士匄來聘。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}